    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Campbells are delighted to present this spectacular sea view site onto the open market.\n\nThis property has had planning permission granted in the past and plans of the most recent application for a change of house type are seen as per the attached plans. \n\nThe planning permission granted was for a spacious modern dwelling thereon maximising the spectacular panoramic unrestricted views from the site. \n\nThe property is ready for construction and is located in this popular location with Maghery seaside village and beach and the local national school within minutes drive. \n\nSeldom does a property of such nature come on to the open market.\n\nFurther information from Campbells.\n\nOur Ref: K1320"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Notice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
